                                "sense_id": "f3603737-e652-3cc2-ba8b-04e03bdc02bb",
                                "text": "The guy she went out with was named Ziki Fuapopo, and the story she told involved his mother, a pile of cocaine, and a group of men dressed in lavalavas."
